{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook Authentic Cuisine:</strong> Master traditional Italian recipes through engaging mini-games to prepare pizza, pasta, bruschetta, and more.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/c7f5ddd6343b85295ff61714f3196695.poster.avif?t=1772000585\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/c7f5ddd6343b85295ff61714f3196695.webm?t=1772000585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/c7f5ddd6343b85295ff61714f3196695.mp4?t=1772000585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Develop Your Restaurant:</strong> Invest your earnings to buy new equipment, expand your menu, and improve your restaurant's interior and ambiance.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/d9462058bb4869db2ecf436361ec8cd0.poster.avif?t=1772000585\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/d9462058bb4869db2ecf436361ec8cd0.webm?t=1772000585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the World:</strong> Visit nearby shops and locations like wineries and farms to discover new opportunities and add unique touches to your cafe.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/edfbbbad7ae7c91566343c5e62b426e6.poster.avif?t=1772000585\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/edfbbbad7ae7c91566343c5e62b426e6.webm?t=1772000585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/extras/edfbbbad7ae7c91566343c5e62b426e6.mp4?t=1772000585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Serve Your Customers:</strong> Take orders, serve meals and drinks, and delight your customers with top-notch service to build a loyal following.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience:</strong> Combine management skills, culinary mastery, and the zest of exploration to build your dream gastronomic business.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a flavorful journey and turn your vacation cafe into the most beloved spot in town!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of an Italian vacation cafe owner and craft the ultimate dining experience! In \u2018<strong>Vacation Cafe Simulator</strong>,\u2019 you'll manage a cozy restaurant, cook delicious Italian dishes, and serve your guests while immersing yourself in the authentic atmosphere of Italy.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3196440?t=1772000585","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3196440?t=1772000585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/04e5e1c44b5a759d1cfeff22d9968da20b64ed5e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772000585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3196440/04e5e1c44b5a759d1cfeff22d9968da20b64ed5e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772000585","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"descripti